{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/form-adorn/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Form adorn","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Decorate inputs with icons, text, and more using a custom wrapper that easily handles styling and positioning."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Apply both <code>.form-control</code> and <code>.form-adorn</code> to a wrapper element. <code>.form-control</code> provides the border, background, padding, and focus states; <code>.form-adorn</code> uses flexbox to position adornments alongside a &quot;ghost input,&quot; a form control that has virtually no visual styling. The <code>.form-ghost</code> input inside is transparent and inherits styles from the wrapper."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use a <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> for the wrapper. The wrapper looks like an input, so people click the icon, the text, or the padding around them and expect the field to take focus. A <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> gives you that for free, because clicking a label focuses the control it labels. No JavaScript is involved."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Mark the adornments with <code>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</code>. A wrapping <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> labels the input, so without it an adornment such as <code>$</code> joins the accessible name and a screen reader announces &quot;Amount $&quot; instead of &quot;Amount&quot;. An adornment is decorative, so keep it out of the accessibility tree and put anything meaningful in the visible label or in a <code>.form-text</code> description."},{"id":"how-it-works--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"An element can have more than one label, so the wrapping <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> and a separate <code>&lt;label for=&quot;…&quot;&gt;</code> work together. Do not put a button or another interactive control inside the wrapper — a <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> must not contain interactive content."}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"See the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/forms/form-control\">form control</a> documentation for more information on the <code>.form-control</code> and <code>.form-ghost</code> classes."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap an icon and a <code>.form-ghost</code> input inside a <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> with <code>.form-control</code> and <code>.form-adorn</code>. Place the adornment before the input in the DOM for start position (left in LTR)."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a48f35b0f65c2404dc05","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"search\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Search...\">\n</label>","language":""},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.form-adorn-end</code> to position the adornment on the trailing side (keeps DOM order, uses CSS to flip visually):"},{"id":"example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"376ac9b98f32bca91a03","height":147},{"id":"example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<label class=\"form-control form-adorn form-adorn-end\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#envelope\" /></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n</label>","language":""},{"id":"with-labels","type":"heading","en":"With labels","level":2},{"id":"with-labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add a second label outside the <code>.form-adorn</code> wrapper to name the field. Point it at the input with <code>for</code>, so the input keeps its name even if you change the wrapper:"},{"id":"with-labels--example-1","type":"demo","key":"665d01fc8065ed92b900","height":174,"anchors":["searchInput","emailInput"]},{"id":"with-labels--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div>\n  <label for=\"searchInput\" class=\"form-label\">Search</label>\n  <label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n    <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"search\" class=\"form-ghost\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Search...\">\n  </label>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <label for=\"emailInput\" class=\"form-label\">Email address</label>\n  <label class=\"form-control form-adorn form-adorn-end\">\n    <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#envelope\" /></svg>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-ghost\" id=\"emailInput\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n  </label>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"with-form-field","type":"heading","en":"With form field","level":2},{"id":"with-form-field--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap a <code>.form-adorn</code> in a <code>.form-field</code> to pair it with a label and description text."},{"id":"with-form-field--example-1","type":"demo","key":"37f3ebcbfb7c9c7eddec","height":147,"anchors":["adornField"]},{"id":"with-form-field--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <label for=\"adornField\" class=\"form-label\">Search</label>\n  <label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n    <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"search\" class=\"form-ghost\" id=\"adornField\" placeholder=\"Search...\">\n  </label>\n  <small class=\"form-text\">Search across all pages and posts.</small>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"text-adornments","type":"heading","en":"Text adornments","level":2},{"id":"text-adornments--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.form-adorn-text</code> for currency symbols, units, domain suffixes, and other text-based adornments. Text adornments auto-size to their content."},{"id":"text-adornments--example-1","type":"demo","key":"4d96f82516c21430945e","height":228},{"id":"text-adornments--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n  <span class=\"form-adorn-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n</label>\n<label class=\"form-control form-adorn form-adorn-end\">\n  <span class=\"form-adorn-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\">USD</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Amount\">\n</label>\n<label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n  <span class=\"form-adorn-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\">https://</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"example.com\">\n</label>\n<label class=\"form-control form-adorn form-adorn-end\">\n  <span class=\"form-adorn-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\">@example.com</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"username\">\n</label>","language":""},{"id":"sizing","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":2},{"id":"sizing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.form-adorn-sm</code> or <code>.form-adorn-lg</code> on the wrapper to adjust sizing."},{"id":"sizing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ef8dc848bc4bc3744211","height":201},{"id":"sizing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label class=\"form-control form-control-sm form-adorn\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Small input\">\n</label>\n<label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Default input\">\n</label>\n<label class=\"form-control form-control-lg form-adorn\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\" /></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Large input\">\n</label>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$form-adorn-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --form-adorn-gap: .375rem,\n    --form-adorn-icon-size: 1rem,\n    --form-adorn-icon-color: var(--fg-2),\n  ),\n  $form-adorn-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"a48f35b0f65c2404dc05","html":"<label class=\"form-control form-adorn\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#search\"></use></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"search\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"Search...\">\n</label>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":"<symbol id=\"search\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M11.742 10.344a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-1.397 1.398h-.001q.044.06.098.115l3.85 3.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.415-1.414l-3.85-3.85a1 1 0 0 0-.115-.1zM12 6.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0\"></path></symbol>"},{"key":"376ac9b98f32bca91a03","html":"<label class=\"form-control form-adorn form-adorn-end\">\n  <div class=\"form-adorn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg class=\"bi\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"#envelope\"></use></svg>\n  </div>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-ghost\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n</label>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":"<symbol id=\"envelope\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M0 4